p['gas_value'],1).' calibrated'):($trap['gas_raw_adc']!==null?e(number_format($trap['gas_raw_adc'],0).' ADC (raw)'):'Not connected') ?></td><td data-field="last_update"><?= $trap['recorded_at']?e(display_date($trap['recorded_at'])):'Awaiting telemetry' ?></td><td data-field="sensor_state"><span class="status-badge status-<?= e(strtolower(str_replace(' ','-',$trap['sensor_state']))) ?>"><?= e($trap['sensor_state']) ?></span></td><td data-field="alerts"><?php if($trap['active_alerts']): foreach($trap['active_alerts'] as $alert): ?><span class="alert-chip severity-<?= e(strtolower($alert['severity'])) ?>"><?= e($alert['label']) ?></span><?php endforeach; else: ?>None<?php endif; ?></td><td><a class="table-action" href="?<?= e(http_build_query(['trap_id'=>$trap['grease_trap_id'],'range'=>'24h'])) ?>">Details</a></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?>
<?php if(!$latest['traps']): ?><tr><td colspan="15" class="empty-state">No grease traps are registered for monitoring.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div></section>
